{
 "id": "rule-9e6dc5f84f60",
 "title": "SDK 把观察者类型声明为 class 时，不写 implements，用标注该类型的对象字面量",
 "product": "代码",
 "triggers": [
  {
   "read": "要传给 SDK 的观察者或回调参数，类型在声明里是 export default class（如 ErrorObserver，供 errorManager.on('error', observer) 用）",
   "wrong": "目标写 class X implements errorManager.ErrorObserver { … }，编译报 Classes cannot be specified in \"implements\" clause (arkts-implements-only-iface)"
  }
 ],
 "scope": "ArkTS 代码向系统 API 传入观察者、回调对象，而参数类型在 SDK 声明里是 class 时",
 "exceptions": [],
 "how": [
  {
   "text": "先查声明里这个类型是 class 还是 interface；是 class 就写 const observer: errorManager.ErrorObserver = { onUnhandledException: (errMsg: string): void => { … }, onException: (errObject: Error): void => { … } }，再 errorManager.on('error', observer)",
   "support": [
    "case-28990049b25bf1086836#recommendation:1",
    "case-28990049b25bf1086836#diagnosis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "保存 on 返回的 number，onDestroy 里用它 errorManager.off('error', id) 反注册；字段类型也写成 errorManager.ErrorObserver",
   "support": [
    "case-28990049b25bf1086836#diagnosis"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "values": [
